WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.350
Tomorrow is Saint Petka's day.

2
00:00:01.350 --> 00:00:04.940
Here is what must never be done on this great holiday.

3
00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:12.120
On 27 October the Serbian Orthodox Church marks Saint Petka, one of the most revered female saints among our people.

4
00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:20.460
Many customs are tied to this holiday, and according to folk belief on that day one should avoid heavy physical and household chores.

5
00:00:20.460 --> 00:00:24.240
Washing laundry, sewing, spinning and weaving are especially mentioned.

6
00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:32.740
In some parts of Serbia it is believed that doing these chores on Saint Petka's day can bring misfortune, illness or unrest to the family.
